. *hl: hlc0005_h
. 
. 
. ***inclusion criteria:
. *only 2016
. *at least one child lb0285 > 0
. 
. 
. * LOAD AND MERGE DATA * 
. 
.         use "$IN/ppathl.dta", clear 
(SOEP-Core, v37 (EU Edition), doi:10.5684/soep.core.v37eu)

.         keep sex pid hid syear corigin

.         
.         * biobirth contains information on fertility history
.         merge m:1 pid using "$IN/biobirth.dta", nogen keep(master matches) ke
> epusing(pid kidsex01-kidsex19 sumkids )
